OL,5,G0800 Great Canal Journeys
OL,6,     FVietnam: The intrepid 'ancient
OL,7,     Fmariners' go on one last far-flung
OL,8,     Fvoyage to southeast Asia,
OL,9,     Ftravelling the waterways of
OL,10,     FVietnam from Halong Bay to Ninh
OL,11,     FBinh, Hoa Lu and Hanoi.
OL,12,G0900 Great Canal Journeys
OL,13,     FVietnam and Cambodia: Timothy West
OL,14,     Fand Prunella Scales' final journey
OL,15,     Ftakes them to Cambodia, where they
OL,16,     Ffinish their travels at Angkor
OL,17,     FWat, a temple built by the clever
OL,18,     Fuse of canals.
